  "body": "In Open UI we have decided for a need to have an `open` state for the `<select>` element when the listbox part is visible. Would you like me to open a PR for this? This attribute will allow styling aspects of the select parts based on the state of the `<select>`.\r\n\r\nhttps://open-ui.org/components/select#open",
